  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Stability in the Western Balkans - Programme funded in-house delivery roles</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Having in-house delivery roles will enable Western Balkans&#x2019;s programming and policy teams, through FRP, to better understand and respond to local political and social dynamics relating to conflict.  This will enable more robust and evidence based programming under FRP and within other programmes in the portfolio, in addition to wider FCDO Western Balkans policy delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
